Reason: port: with frame_rate = 60 or 120 the birds (TAnimalBird) flew, took off, turned and landed at half or a quarter speed; their steps run on every 1/120 s movement tick but scale by SMSGetAnmFrameRate(), a per-frame rate; use its 30 fps value
